            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIGHLY DISTRACTED EDITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete visual rebuild for a game you play with one eye on the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545030/extras/c825cb9fcb4b814a3ee1de6e350c1a24.webp?t=1788231735\" width=630 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored at work? Got a boss who never looks over your screen… until he does?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then this game is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545030/extras/7591c7c044fd8cab4767d40eed0ef150.webp?t=1788231735\" width=630 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Stefan. Twenty-two, fresh out of art school, and somehow already employed at one of the biggest design firms in the city. Dream job on paper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He hated it by lunchtime on day one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So he starts filling the hours with something more interesting. A little browsing between deadlines. Then a lot of browsing. Then it stops being between deadlines at all. Seven days is all it takes to find out how far a bad habit can go and what it costs when your co-workers start noticing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545030/extras/d9283302a1e8e96d64f17f1d15662699.webp?t=1788231735\" width=630 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD Edition with every pixel redrawn. Over 600 assets rebuilt from the ground up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to put down. Click, watch, and don't get caught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two ways to slack: a full Story Mode and an endless Simulator Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge a snitching co-worker and a boss with terrible timing. Get caught, and you're FIRED!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash in with a pile of mini-games between distractions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock videos, software, gimmicks, story beats, and plenty more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Prefer the original? The 2016 version stays playable. Switch to it any time from the game's beta branch in your Steam library.</i></strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIGHLY DISTRACTED EDITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete visual rebuild for a game you play with one eye on the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545030/extras/c825cb9fcb4b814a3ee1de6e350c1a24.webp?t=1788231735\" width=630 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored at work? Got a boss who never looks over your screen… until he does?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then this game is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545030/extras/7591c7c044fd8cab4767d40eed0ef150.webp?t=1788231735\" width=630 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Stefan. Twenty-two, fresh out of art school, and somehow already employed at one of the biggest design firms in the city. Dream job on paper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He hated it by lunchtime on day one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So he starts filling the hours with something more interesting. A little browsing between deadlines. Then a lot of browsing. Then it stops being between deadlines at all. Seven days is all it takes to find out how far a bad habit can go and what it costs when your co-workers start noticing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/545030/extras/d9283302a1e8e96d64f17f1d15662699.webp?t=1788231735\" width=630 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD Edition with every pixel redrawn. Over 600 assets rebuilt from the ground up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to put down. Click, watch, and don't get caught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two ways to slack: a full Story Mode and an endless Simulator Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge a snitching co-worker and a boss with terrible timing. Get caught, and you're FIRED!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash in with a pile of mini-games between distractions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock videos, software, gimmicks, story beats, and plenty more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Prefer the original? The 2016 version stays playable. Switch to it any time from the game's beta branch in your Steam library.</i></strong></p>",
